  "cost": { "wallClockMinutes": 14, "workedBy": "agent", "notes": "2 fetches. The admin-code chapter TOC + definitions section was enough; did not drill into every subsection. Confirmed 'no income test' by its ABSENCE across the DCF page and the code's stated purpose (a payment 'to assist with the expenses of providing care'), which is weaker evidence than a positive statement." },
